      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes a lot of sense. I'm particularly concerned about the \"chaotic\" element you mentioned. If the disruption is something that feels almost irrational or unpredictable—not a standard disaster, but something that just creates total havoc and breaks the normal order of things—how would a legal professional even begin to categorize that in a formal filing? Is there a way to frame \"unpredictable chaos\" that courts will actually respect?",
